{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer about climbing an endless mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Everything is physically simulated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_kick_rock.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your Path and your BUFFs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_climb.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_sit_on_camp_fire.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>Demo coming August 2025</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798950?t=1750875340","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798950?t=1750875340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/3847dfc43f7c2203074247f1985bd06dabe59fc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750875340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/3847dfc43f7c2203074247f1985bd06dabe59fc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750875340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buff Climbers</strong> is a rogue-like platformer about climbing an endless mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both <u>local</u> and <u>online</u> multiplayer are supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Everything is physically simulated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_kick_rock.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single rock might roll onto a bomb and set off a chain reaction. A pot bouncing off a slime\u2019s head could trigger an avalanche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t expect to survive your first expedition. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your Path and your BUFFs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_climb.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the mountain as day turns into night. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up camp at dusk, choose your path and your <strong>BUFFs</strong>, and prepare for a new set of dangers and rewards each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With randomly generated floors and hazards, no two climbs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don\u2019t forget the <u>loot</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/extras/steam_description_sit_on_camp_fire.gif?t=1750875340\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mountain lures climbers with promises of glory and riches. Spend your <u>gold</u> on <u>rare items</u> and powerful <strong>BUFFs</strong> to boost your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You <i>can</i> climb together! But beware: some people are born griefers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still, it might be wise to bring a friend (or two). The mountain is tall and treacherous. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Besides, they might carry your body to safety for a respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>Demo coming August 2025</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["ArcadeNest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798950/4ac2cbcdbaf67e07cb6704d71d029ca5e1dfe9c6/header.jpg?t=1750875340","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151114,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie480.mp4?t=1750802269","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie_max.mp4?t=1750802269"},"name":"in progress trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151114/13baebb2a22a1c6454e5427e1652047113f8bf23/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750802269","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750802269","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151114/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750802269"}}],"name":"Buff Climbers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</s